# SPA rewrite: every path that is not a real file renders index.html so
# React Router owns routing (docs/PROJECT_PLAN.md §11).
#
# This does NOT shadow /sw.js or /manifest.webmanifest. Cloudflare Pages
# matches static assets in the build output BEFORE consulting this file,
# so a request for an existing file is served as that file — the rewrite
# only ever fires for paths with no asset behind them. Worth stating
# because the failure it would cause is silent and total: a service
# worker served as text/html is rejected by every browser with a MIME
# type error, and Web Push depends entirely on that registration.
/*  /index.html  200
